culty could impair crew coordination.\n\nA's anticipation and leadership are valuable, but show-off and closed to ideas may affect teamwork.\n\nWhich candidate is best? Hard. Perhaps we can argue that Candidate B, despite communication issues, has the most reliable and stress-resilient profile, which are top criteria. We can propose to address communication via training. So recommendation B.\n\nWe need to reference discussion (none). We can say \"Given we are starting, I propose...\" That's okay.\n\nLet's produce public message stating recommendation Candidate B, referencing facts: very conscientious, handles stress well, but note communication issue. Explain why still best.\n\nMetadata vote: Candidate B."}
